# Roundtrip test skip list: known divergences in source reconstruction.
#
# Format: <phase> <version-range> <path-or-glob>[: reason]
#
# - phase: ast or src
#     ast = re-parsed AST differs from original (or re-parse fails)
#     src = source text differs (but AST roundtrip may still pass)
# - version-range: same as golden.skip (2.7, ..2.6, 3.0.., 2.0..2.6, *)
# - path relative to repo root, single-* glob per segment
